From 954bbe342720d18a6d2e0bf8079d4c2d1a94d462 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Li Ruilin <liruilin4@huawei.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Mar 2026 20:11:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 14/18] fix: update documentation and unify logging

This commit addresses several issues in the documentation and logging:

1. Update documentation in obmm_log.md:
   - Remove redundant field descriptions
   - Add syslog service error to troubleshooting section
   - Improve documentation clarity

2. Unify logging in vendor_adaptor.c:
   - Replace pr_err with OBMM_LOGE for consistent logging
   - Add missing error logs for better debugging

3. Fix header file order in libobmm.c:
   - Reorganize header includes for better readability
   - Define SIZE_STR_BUFFER_SIZE_PER_NODE macro

These changes improve code maintainability and documentation clarity.

Signed-off-by: Li Ruilin <liruilin4@huawei.com>
